5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Hello everyone. I am Daisuke. I am a bit nervous, but I hope we can find the truth together.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,Shion here. I prefer to observe before speaking. Let us see who reveals themselves first.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,Shunichi. I am calm and ready. Let's not waste time with small talk. Who is the wolf?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hi, I'm Midori. I love cooking and harmony. Let's keep the atmosphere friendly while we investigate.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,George,,Good evening. I am George. I have seen many things. Let us proceed with logic and patience.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I agree with George. Patience is key. I will try to listen carefully to everyone's words.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Daisuke, your caution is noted. Shunichi, your aggression is premature. We have no data yet.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Shion, I am just being direct. We need to move fast. Midori, your friendliness is suspicious.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"Shunichi, that is harsh. I am just being kind. Let's focus on facts, not feelings.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,George,,"Shunichi, your tone is unnecessary. Midori, kindness is not a crime. Let us observe the night.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I am sorry for the tension. I just want to help. Let's stay calm and watch closely.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Daisuke, your passivity is a weakness. Shunichi, your sarcasm is a mask. Who is hiding?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Shion, you are overthinking. I am who I am. Let's see who blinks first tonight.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I think we are all just trying to survive. Let's not jump to conclusions. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,George,,Agreed. Rest well. The night will reveal the truth. I will keep my eyes open.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,Good night. I hope everyone is safe. I will try to stay strong.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shion,,Good night. I will watch. Let us see who lies in the morning.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,Good night. Sleep tight. The wolf is hungry.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Good night, everyone. Let's hope for a peaceful morning.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,George,,Good night. May the dawn bring clarity.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
