39,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I am worried. George, please tell us who is safe. We need to know who to trust.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,George,,I divined Shunichi. He is a werewolf. We must vote to execute him immediately.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
